1. Definitions

In this Licence, the following terms have the following meanings:

"Licensee" means any person exercising rights under this Licence.

"You" means the Licensee, or a third party acting on their behalf.

"Documentation" means schematic diagrams, designs, circuit or board layouts, mechanical drawings,
CAD files, and other materials describing the hardware design licensed under this Licence.

"Product" means any device manufactured using the Documentation or modified Documentation.

"Source" means the preferred format for making modifications to the Documentation.

"Modified Documentation" means any modifications made to the Documentation, including 
without limitation corrections, additions, or deletions.

