CERN grants You a world-wide, royalty-free, non-exclusive, sublicensable licence to use, reproduce,
modify, and distribute the Documentation and Products under the terms of this Licence.

You must:

- provide a copy of this Licence with the Documentation or Product;
- retain copyright notices;
- make the Source of any Modified Documentation available under this Licence.

3. Reciprocal Obligations

If You distribute or manufacture Products using Modified Documentation, You must:

- make the Modified Documentation available under this Licence;
